WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:07.050
Every quote that gets accepted lands here as an order.

2
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.370
One line each newest first, and where it has got to.

3
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.283
Some are with the customer waiting on artwork, some are on the floor,

4
00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:15.530
some are out the door.

5
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.970
An enquiry becomes a quote, a quote becomes an order and the stage updates here.

6
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.530
The pipeline is the same orders as a board.

7
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.330
Most of these stages move on their own.

8
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:31.810
An order comes in and the customer is asked for their artwork.

9
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:35.350
Artwork arrives and the studio is told to make the proof.

10
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.350
The proof goes out for approval.

11
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:41.270
You set how long Presslane waits before it chases.

12
00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.590
Approved, and it goes into production.

13
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.990
The floor works to scanners, every order carries a barcode.

14
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:52.350
Scan it and the job moves: production complete then pick and pack.

15
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:58.030
Every time a stage is reached the customer is told, customers stop ringing to ask.

16
00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:03.210
Then the shipping label and the order barcode and the tracking number goes out on its own.

17
00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.650
The floor updates the system, Runs the shop while you print.

